{"seq":8,"slug":"history-of-ai-and-computing","title":"人工智能与计算的历史","stage":"DONE","category":"history","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing","rating":{"composite":3.92,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"人工智能与计算的历史-简介\">人工智能与计算的历史 简介</h1><h2 id=\"hub-定位\">Hub 定位</h2><p>本 hub 沿着两条彼此缠绕的主线，追溯从抽象的数理逻辑到会学习的机器的漫长历程。第一条线是「计算」：人类如何把推理本身变成可执行的形式系统，从计数与算筹，经布尔代数、可计算性理论，落到机械齿轮、电子管与硅片之上。第二条线是「智能」：当计算足够强大之后，人们如何尝试让机器去模拟感知与思考，是符号推理的雄心，也是神经网络的沉浮。</p>\n<p>这两条线并非简单先后，而是不断互相喂养：逻辑的形式化给了计算机以蓝图，计算机的算力又反过来让智能的构想成为可能。本 hub 关注的是这一过程中的思想史与技术转折——观念如何诞生、受挫、蛰伏、再爆发，而非某一台具体机器的技术细节。</p>\n<p>与同 category 的 <a href=\"../../history/technology-history/\">科技发展史</a> 的边界：后者以工业与技术的宽泛变革为主线，覆盖蒸汽、电力、内燃机到数字化的全景；本 hub 则把镜头收窄到计算与人工智能这一条支脉，追问的是形式系统与机器智能自身的演进逻辑。两者视角互补，而非重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><p>本 hub 共四章，按「理论—硬件—软件—智能」的层次递进，建议按序阅读以建立完整的因果链。</p>\n<p>第一章「计算理论的基础」从数制与古代计算工具讲起，经莱布尼茨、布尔、弗雷格与希尔伯特的形式化努力，到达哥德尔不完备定理与图灵机——正是这一串抽象工作，事先为后来的机器划定了能力边界。</p>\n<p>第二章「硬件计算的演进」落在物理实现上：战时密码学驱动出的 ENIAC、冯·诺依曼存储程序架构的确立、晶体管与微处理器带来的个人计算革命。硬件每一次跃迁，都重画了「什么可以被计算」的现实成本。</p>\n<p>第三章「软件与互联网的演进」转向软性的组织问题：编程语言的演化与软件危机、操作系统与软件工程的成熟、互联网与数字融合如何把孤立机器连成全球基础设施。</p>\n<p>第四章「人工智能的演进」回到第二条主线：达特茅斯会议与符号主义的黄金年代、两次 AI 寒冬与专家系统的兴衰、连接主义与机器学习直至深度学习的复兴。这一章是理解当下 AI 热潮从何而来的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>对计算机、互联网和智能手机的功能有日常层面的了解即可，不需要数学或工程的专业背景。本 hub 讲的是「观念如何发生、技术为何转折」，而非公式推导或代码实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../../history/technology-history/\">科技发展史</a> — 把计算与 AI 放回更宽的工业技术变革脉络中观察</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../history/historiography-historical-method/\">史学方法论</a> — 理解历史叙事如何被建构，有助于批判性地阅读技术史</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations-of-computing-theory","title":"计算理论与机械起源","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/foundations-of-computing-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"number-systems-and-calculating-tools","title":"数字表示与早期计算工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/foundations-of-computing-theory/number-systems-and-calculating-tools"},{"seq":2,"slug":"logic-and-computability-foundations","title":"数理逻辑与可计算性理论的奠基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/foundations-of-computing-theory/logic-and-computability-foundations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mechanical-computing-and-babbage","title":"机械计算机与分析机的历史实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/foundations-of-computing-theory/mechanical-computing-and-babbage"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"hardware-computing-evolution","title":"硬件与体系结构演进","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/hardware-computing-evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wartime-computing-and-eniac","title":"战时密码破译与电子计算机诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/hardware-computing-evolution/wartime-computing-and-eniac"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stored-program-architecture-mainframes","title":"存储程序架构与大型机时代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/hardware-computing-evolution/stored-program-architecture-mainframes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"transistor-microprocessor-personal-computer","title":"晶体管、集成电路与个人计算机革命","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/hardware-computing-evolution/transistor-microprocessor-personal-computer"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"software-internet-evolution","title":"软件、网络与数字时代","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/software-internet-evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"programming-languages-and-software-crisis","title":"编程语言演进与软件危机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/software-internet-evolution/programming-languages-and-software-crisis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"operating-systems-and-software-engineering","title":"操作系统与软件工程方法的成熟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/software-internet-evolution/operating-systems-and-software-engineering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"internet-and-digital-convergence","title":"互联网兴起与数字时代的融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/software-internet-evolution/internet-and-digital-convergence"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"artificial-intelligence-evolution","title":"人工智能演进史","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/artificial-intelligence-evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-birth-and-symbolic-ai","title":"人工智能的诞生与符号主义范式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/artificial-intelligence-evolution/ai-birth-and-symbolic-ai"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-winters-and-expert-systems","title":"AI 寒冬、专家系统与知识工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/artificial-intelligence-evolution/ai-winters-and-expert-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"connectionism-machine-learning-deep-learning","title":"连接主义、机器学习与深度学习复兴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/artificial-intelligence-evolution/connectionism-machine-learning-deep-learning"}]}]}